// V2.0: the basic attack of each weapon category. Balance and the numbers
// behind each column: docs/EQUIPMENT_EXPANSION_V2_0.md §21.
//   reach/height: strike size (world units); gap: empty space between the
//   body centre and the strike; raise: strike centre above the body centre;
//   attack_time: swing at attack speed 1 (strike active for the first 60%);
//   recovery: extra committed time; power: multiplier on ATK.
//   two_handed (V2.1): no off-hand item (shield) at the same time.
//   Optional (V2.4, docs/COMBAT_FEEL_V2_4.md; omitted = as before):
//   startup (s, inside attack_time, before the strike can hit),
//   active_fraction (default 0.6), cancel_after (share of the whole action
//   from which jump/dodge/guard/attack cancel it; default none),
//   air_control (0..1, default 0), turn_window (s, default 0),
//   rehit_interval (s, default none = each target once).
// The Sword row is the pre-V2.0 basic attack (core/constants.rs): the
// starting Iron Sword strikes exactly as before.
(
    weapon_classes: [
        (category: Sword, name: "Sword", reach: 46.0, height: 26.0, gap: 8.0, raise: 4.0,
            attack_time: 0.28, recovery: 0.0, power: 1.0),
        (category: Dagger, name: "Dagger", reach: 28.0, height: 22.0, gap: 6.0, raise: 2.0,
            attack_time: 0.17, recovery: 0.0, power: 0.55),
        (category: Axe, name: "Axe", reach: 50.0, height: 36.0, gap: 8.0, raise: 6.0,
            attack_time: 0.38, recovery: 0.14, power: 1.45),
        (category: Spear, name: "Spear", reach: 78.0, height: 16.0, gap: 26.0, raise: 2.0,
            attack_time: 0.32, recovery: 0.06, power: 1.1, two_handed: true),
        (category: HeavyWeapon, name: "Heavy weapon", reach: 62.0, height: 46.0, gap: 8.0, raise: 10.0,
            attack_time: 0.52, recovery: 0.26, power: 2.1, two_handed: true),
    ],
)
